A very poor man's touch can be done with

COPY file+NUL

(Don't add the /b in vain hope of protecting binary files; it isn't
necessary, it makes it take longer, and the timestamp ends up
unchanged.   Binary files should be unhurt even without the /b.)

The UnxUtils zip file that cannot be downloaded from the home page,
can be downloaded through the sourceforge distribution system, from
this link. (You may have to select a mirror.)

